// spec: stdlib Time; 12 Runtime panics
// panics: Channel.close
// A ticker's channel only receives, as Go's is receive-only: a send panics, and so does a close.
var ctx = Context.new()
var ticks = Time.ticker(Time.duration(milliseconds: 10), ctx)
println(Panic.catch({ Channel.send(ticks, Time.fromEpochMillis(0)) }) is Err)
Channel.close(ticks)

// expect
// exit: 1
// out: true
// err: Channel.close: a ticker's channel only receives
